    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「あぁ、ごめんよ――突き飛ばしちまったかい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 41,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「あんた、男なのにひょろひょろしてんじゃないよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「うちの弟のほうがよっぽど頑丈だよ、だいじょうぶ？　立てるかい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 41,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「まったく、ひどい人混みだね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「購買部っていつも昼休みはこんな混んでんのかい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「近所のスーパーのバーゲンセールのときより酷い有様だよ、まったく」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 41,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「あぁ？　うん、いつもは自分でつくってくるか友達に買ってきてもらうんだけどね――」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 41,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「いや、パシらせてるわけじゃなくて。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 41,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「昼休みにいつも友達と腕相撲で勝負してさ、負けたほうが買いに行くって決まりになってんだよ、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「たいがい勝つけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「その友達――いかりって娘がまた負けず嫌いでねぇ、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「負けても負けても挑戦してくっからいいかげん鬱陶しくてさ、今日はわざと負けてやったんだけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 41,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「手ぇ抜いたのがわかったのかねぇ、いつもの何倍も怒ってね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「ご機嫌とるためにも、あいつの好きなもん買っていってやりたいんだけど――」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「あいつ、何が好きなんだろ？　水泳部だし、白身魚のフライ弁当とかでいいんかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 41,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「あれ、いつの間にかすごい空いてる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 41,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「んん？　あたいに突き飛ばされそうで怖いからってみんな逃げた？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「失礼しちゃうねぇ、お年頃の乙女をダンプカーみたいに言っちゃってさ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 41,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いさみ",
    "text": "「まぁいいや、ん～っと。ど・れ・に・し・よ・う・かな～♪」"
  }
